      "Section": "Featured Commitment Taxonomy Versions",
      "Anchor": "featured-commitment-taxonomy-versions",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Organizational values and principles that companies showcase on their LinkedIn page. There are five values: Diversity, equity, and inclusion (DEI); Environmental sustainability; Work-life balance; Social impact; and Career growth and learning.",
